    "estimated": "4.00 occ x 45 min/occ (estimate, mid of 20-90, basis inferred, 4 quotes from 4 occurrences) = 180.00 min = 13.02 min/mo; automatable 50% (estimate) = 6.51 min/mo; at the low end 20 min/occ = $5.89/mo, at the high end 90 min/occ = $20.25/mo (the row's automatable total)",
    "total": "today 15.55 min/mo = 0.26 h/mo = $22.03/mo (email 2.53 min/mo = $3.58 + work 13.02 min/mo = $18.45); automatable 7.78 min/mo = 0.13 h/mo = $11.02/mo (counted email 1.27 min/mo = $1.80 + estimated work 6.51 min/mo = $9.22)"
